My screen stays empty.
I check the reception.
The reception is very good.
I wait another minute.
Then the screen goes black.
I do not want to wait anymore.
I open the help section on the website.
I find an alternative there.
On the screen it says: "The code is being sent to your old email address."
I click on this option.
Mostly that also goes very quickly.
I open my old email account from Mexico.
The email is already there.
I enter the new code.
On the screen it says: "Your request is being processed."
Everything together takes only four minutes.
